<p class="slide-panel__desc">
  {{ podcast.description }}
</p>

<div class="about-body">
  <h3>Our Mission</h3>
  <p>We believe in fostering open, honest dialogue about the future of higher education. Through the podcast, we aim to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Share diverse perspectives on higher ed technology</li>
    <li>Challenge conventional thinking about digital transformation</li>
    <li>Connect higher ed professionals with innovative solutions</li>
    <li>Promote best practices in educational technology</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>About the Host</h3>
  <p>Higher Ed Hot Takes is hosted by <strong>{{ podcast.author }}</strong> of <strong>{{ podcast.owner.name }}</strong> — bringing hands-on experience and a counterculture perspective to the work of higher ed marketing.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>Have a question or want to be a guest on the show? Reach out at <a href="mailto:{{ podcast.contact.email }}">{{ podcast.contact.email }}</a>.</p>
</div>
